  - "Ha compartido cr\xE9ditos de interpretaci\xF3n con Dhanush y Jonita Gandhi."
  - "Las referencias directas son \xABMegham Karukatha (From \"Thiruchitrambalam\")\xBB
    y \xABThenmozhi (From \"Thiruchitrambalam\")\xBB."
  - "Nombre musical asociado directamente a \xABMegham Karukatha (From \"Thiruchitrambalam\")\xBB,
